<title>UK: Mersey Docks says Q1 results in line.</title>
<headline>Mersey Docks says Q1 results in line.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>British port operator Mersey Docks and Harbour Company Plc said on Tuesday that results for the first quarter are in line with expectations.  </p>
<p>The company told shareholders at its annual meeting that work has started on a joint venture with the David McLean Group to re-develop Princes Dock, Liverpool in Northern England.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
